    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Synthetic user lifecycle (no SAP)\n\nRuns against the contract fixture started with `CONTRACT_MODE=user-provisioning`. Each step is a separate governed alias: `createSu01CommunicationUser`, `lockSu01User`, `unlockSu01User`, `resetSu01UserPassword`. Every node needs its own typed confirmation (`CREATE`, `LOCK`, `UNLOCK`, `RESET` + username). The reset sets the sidecar-held initial password: n8n never sends or receives a password.\n\nUse a dedicated *User Provisioning* credential pointing at the fixture. Re-running needs a new username in step 1 (and its confirmation), or start from step 2 with the pre-created `N8N_DEMO_00`.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 620
      },
